alternative_name: Labne Breakfast Bowl with Fruit
ingredient_count: 6
---

Wash and dry fruit.

Cut @apple{1} into thin slices.

Next, spoon @Labne{2-4%ounces} into each #bowl{}.

Then, arrange @blueberries{4%tbsp}, @blackberries{4%tbsp}, and @cherries{4} on top of the Labne.

Add @?Almonds{2%tbsp}(sliced).

Finally, garnish with @?Cocoa Powder{1%pinch}.